<title>USA: Sri Lanka buys 100,000 T Australia/Argentine wheat. [CORRECTED 02:15 GMT 28/11]</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka buys 100,000 T Australia/Argentine wheat. [CORRECTED 02:15 GMT 28/11]</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka bought on Tuesday night a total of 100,000 tonnes of Australian and Argentinian wheat, U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>The deal included 50,000 tonnes of Australian soft wheat at around $169.25 a tonne, cost and freight, slated for December 23 to January 1 delivery. (Corrects price and delivery dates).</p>
<p>Another lot of 50,000 tonnes was Argentinian hard wheat at about $162.00-$163.93 a tonne, C and F, due for January 6-15 delivery.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
